# Cloudinary image upload configuration
# Used for sharing lesson designs with images via link.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Sign up at https://cloudinary.com (free tier: 25 GB storage + bandwidth/month)
#   2. Go to Settings > Upload > Upload presets
#   3. Create a new preset, set "Signing Mode" to "Unsigned"
#   4. Copy your Cloud Name from the Dashboard
#   5. Create .env.local (already in .gitignore) and fill in the values below:

VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your_cloud_name
VITE_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=your_unsigned_preset_name
